        "original_id": "eaf246c1-eb40-5332-9722-02107eaa3804",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: BRABUS GmbH, smart Automobile, Daimler AG\n- Products: Brabus Bullit, Smart Brabus electric drive, Smart Forstars\n- Places: Bottrop, Ruhr Area, Böblingen, Germany\n- Topics: aftermarket tuning, automotive marques, electric drivetrains\n\nFacts:\n- BRABUS GmbH was founded in 1977 in Bottrop in the Ruhr Area of Germany.\n- BRABUS GmbH is a high-performance aftermarket tuning company that specializes in Mercedes-Benz, Smart, Tesla, and Maybach vehicles.\n- smart Automobile is a German automotive marque and a division of Daimler AG based in Böblingen, Germany.\n- The Brabus Bullit is an automobile designed and made by Brabus.\n- The Smart Forstars has an all-electric drivetrain that is nearly identical to the drivetrain used in the Smart Brabus electric drive.",
